     "en": "The prototype's angler was a person; I made it a cat, then iterated: the tail was too thick to read as a cat's, it needed to be more anthropomorphic, cross-legged, in a bucket hat. Once it sat in the boat it floated apart from the hull, so we cut it to the upper body. Whiskers came last. The whole screen is 180×320 and the cat is about twenty pixels wide, so every pixel has a job."
